# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出也用 LF
# 原因：backend/ 下的 shell 脚本要上传到 Linux 运行，
# 若检出为 CRLF 会报 `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M: no such file or directory`
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保持 CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.hap binary
*.p12 binary
*.p7b binary
*.cer binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
